    SpecificationSource: 'FICTIONAL VEHICLE. No specification here is taken from a real car. Figures were
      authored to be mutually consistent for an 1180 kg front-drive turbocharged
      hatchback: 250 Nm from 1900 rpm, roughly 170 hp, a nose-heavy 62/38 balance,
      softer rear springs and an open-ish front differential, so it understeers on
      power where the coupe oversteers.'
